<main>
  <h1>Posebook</h1>
  <p>Invitation-based registration and booking for recurring programs, built for figure drawing.</p>
  <p>Welcome, <%= current_user.name %>.</p>
  <% if current_user.system_admin? %>
    <p>You have the system admin role.</p>
  <% end %>
  <p><%= link_to "View Programs", programs_path %> to see your programs, calendar, and booking history.</p>
  <p>Accept a personal invitation to join a program, then choose an available booking date. Automated reminders are not available yet.</p>
</main>
